<main class="sheet-content">
<div class="two-col">
<section class="q-card"><h3>משלימים ריבוע</h3>
<p>נתונים שלושה קודקודים: <span class="math-ltr" dir="ltr">A(2,1), B(6,1), C(6,5)</span>.</p>
<div aria-label="שלושה קודקודים של ריבוע" class="coordinate-grid grid-large" data-arrows="[]" data-points='[{"x": 2, "y": 1, "label": "A", "dx": 10, "dy": -10}, {"x": 6, "y": 1, "label": "B", "dx": 10, "dy": -10}, {"x": 6, "y": 5, "label": "C", "dx": 10, "dy": -10}]' data-polygons="[]" data-segments='[{"from": [2, 1], "to": [6, 1], "type": "shape"}, {"from": [6, 1], "to": [6, 5], "type": "shape"}]' role="img"></div>
